  "statement": "Evaluate the infinite sum\n\n\\[\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty} \\log _{2}\\left(\\frac{1-\\frac{1}{n}}{1-\\frac{1}{n+1}}\\right)\\]",
  "answerChoices": [],
